ography": "Greg Brenman is an English film and television producer.\nAs previous Head of Drama at UK's Tiger Aspect Productions, he produced over 400 hours of British TV drama.  Titles include Peaky Blinders, Ripper Street, My Mad Fat Diary, Prisoners' Wives, Robin Hood and Secret Diary of a Call Girl.\nIn film, Brenman has produced films such Omagh, White Girl, and Billy Elliot.\nIn 2013, Brenman, with colleague Roanna Benn, formed Drama Republic, a new specialty drama production company. Drama Republic produced Doctor Foster, which Brenman is an executive producer of.\nIn 2017, it was announced that Brenamn would executive produce the Hugo Blick series The Forgiving Earth, which will air on BBC Two and Netflix.", "biography_author": "Wikidata", "date_of_biography": "2023-08-01T15:04:44.951986+10:00", "external_links": [{"id": 4101, "uri": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greg_Brenman"}], "uuid": "5311cbb8-922a-47bf-a87d-fa0b328c564f", "source": {"name": "Vernon", "slug": "vernon"}, "source_identifier": "20043", "external_references": [{"id": 26075, "source": {"name": "Wikidata", "slug": "wikidata"}, "source_identifier": "Q16727647"}, {"id": 28758, "source": {"name": "VIAF", "slug": "viaf"}, "source_identifier": "301377036"}, {"id": 28759, "source": {"name": "WorldCat", "slug": "worldcat"}, "source_identifier": "lccn-no98046505"}], "date_modified": "2023-09-05T20:21:21.817725+10:00"}, {"id": 32492, "name": "Andrew Benson", "roles_in_work": [{"id": 2350086, "title": "The Frogs and the lobsters", "work_id": 91946, "role": "producer", "role_id": 1089, "is_primary": true}, {"id": 2350180, "title": "The Even chance", "work_id": 90783, "role": "producer", "role_id": 1089, "is_primary": true}, {"id": 2350152, "title": "The Duchess and the devil", "work_id": 91945, "role": "producer", "role_id": 1089, "is_primary": true}, {"id": 2350055, "title": "Hornblower", "work_id": 115561, "role": "producer", "role_id": 1089, "is_primary": true}, {"id": 2350120, "title": "Examination f